  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coorperation agreement with European Centre for Development Policy Management 2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to ensure more informed actors, more inclusive dialogues and processes, more coherent and integrated policies, and more effective multi-actor partnerships in relation to a number of development policy issues of high priority for Denmark.  ECDPM is an independent &quot;think and do tank&quot; specialised in EU development policies and focused on inclusive sustainable development. They have valuable insights on North/South dynamics, EU collaboration, and current issues within topics such as global health, gender, trade and investments, migration, and security.</narrative>
  </description>
